2a:["$","section",null,{"aria-labelledby":"answer-heading","className":"section-container relative z-10 -mt-8 max-w-6xl","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-[2rem] border border-[#16A34A]/15 bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_30px_70px_-45px_rgba(15,23,42,0.5)] md:p-9","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-[auto_1fr] md:gap-8","children":[["$","p",null,{"id":"answer-heading","className":"text-[0.7rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#16A34A] md:w-32 md:pt-1","children":"The short answer"}],["$","p",null,{"id":"speakable-summary","className":"text-[1.05rem] leading-relaxed text-[#1F2937] md:text-lg","children":"Taxi Saudi Arabia arranges pre-booked private transfers for NEOM through a vetted partner network. Most visitors land at Tabuk Regional Airport (TUU), about 180 km (~2 hr 45 min) from NEOM, or at Red Sea International (about 300 km). Confirmed points are NEOM Bay / Sharma, Magna and Oxagon; for other NEOM sites, send the location and we confirm first — site access is arranged by your host. Aqaba in Jordan is about 235 km via the Al Durrah crossing."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-7","children":["$","dl",null,{"className":"grid grid-cols-2 gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-3xl border border-[#16A34A]/15 bg-[#16A34A]/15 md:grid-cols-4","children":[["$","div","Tabuk Airport → NEOM",{"className":"bg-white p-4 md:p-5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#15803D]","children":"Tabuk Airport → NEOM"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-1.5 text-[0.85rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1C1C1C]","children":"180 km · ~2 hr 45 min"}]]}],["$","div","Red Sea Airport → NEOM",{"className":"bg-white p-4 md:p-5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#15803D]","children":"Red Sea Airport → NEOM"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-1.5 text-[0.85rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1C1C1C]","children":"300 km · ~3.5 hr"}]]}],["$","div","NEOM → Aqaba",{"className":"bg-white p-4 md:p-5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#15803D]","children":"NEOM → Aqaba"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-1.5 text-[0.85rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1C1C1C]","children":"235 km · ~3 hr"}]]}],["$","div","Confirmed points",{"className":"bg-white p-4 md:p-5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#15803D]","children":"Confirmed points"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-1.5 text-[0.85rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1C1C1C]","children":"Sharma, Magna, Oxagon"}]]}],["$","div","Site access",{"className":"bg-white p-4 md:p-5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#15803D]","children":"Site access"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-1.5 text-[0.85rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1C1C1C]","children":"Arranged by your host"}]]}],["$","div","Companies",{"className":"bg-white p-4 md:p-5","children":[["$","dt",null,{"className":"text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-[#15803D]","children":"Companies"}],["$","dd",null,{"className":"mt-1.5 text-[0.85rem] font-semibold leading-snug text-[#1C1C1C]","children":"Invoicing via our sister company"}]]}]]}]}]]}]}]
2b:["$","div",null,{"className":"section-container max-w-6xl space-y-20 py-20 md:space-y-28 md:py-28","children":[["$","section",null,{"aria-labelledby":"trip-heading","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"mb-8 md:mb-10 max-w-3xl","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-3 text-[0.7rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-[#16A34A]","children":"Start here"}],["$","h2",null,{"id":"trip-heading","className":"font-heading text-[1.75rem] font-bold leading-tight md:text-[2.25rem] text-[#1C1C1C]","children":"What do you need around NEOM?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-3 text-[0.95rem] leading-relaxed text-[#6B7280]","children":"Most NEOM trips start at an airport and end at a site or hotel — or go on to Jordan."}]]}],["$","$L36",null,{"trips":[{"id":"tuu","icon":"plane","label":"Tabuk Airport → NEOM","short":"180 km","answer":"The main arrival route: about 180 km (~2 hr 45 min) from TUU. We track the flight, meet you at arrivals, and the first 15–30 minutes of waiting are free.","send":["Flight number","NEOM destination (Sharma / Magna / Oxagon / other)","Passengers and luggage"],"href":"/routes/tabuk-airport-to-neom","linkLabel":"Tabuk Airport to NEOM transfer","waPrefill":"Salam! Tabuk Airport → NEOM.\n• Flight number: \n• NEOM destination: \n• Date & time: \n• Passengers & luggage: \n(ref: neom-hub)"},{"id":"rsi","icon":"plane","label":"Red Sea Airport → NEOM","short":"300 km","answer":"From Red Sea International (RSI) the drive is about 300 km (~3.5 hr) up the coast.","send":["Flight number","NEOM destination","Passengers"],"href":"/routes/red-sea-airport-to-neom","linkLabel":"Red Sea Airport to NEOM","waPrefill":"Salam! Red Sea Airport → NEOM.\n• Flight number: \n• NEOM destination: \n• Date & time: \n• Passengers: \n(ref: neom-hub)"},{"id":"aqaba","icon":"route","label":"NEOM ↔ Aqaba, Jordan","short":"235 km via Al Durrah","answer":"NEOM to Aqaba is about 235 km through the Al Durrah crossing near Haql. The vehicle's border fees are included; passengers bring their own passports and visas. Our Jordan partner can take you on door to door.","send":["NEOM pickup","Aqaba address or airport","Date and time","Passengers and nationalities"],"href":"/routes/neom-to-aqaba","linkLabel":"NEOM to Aqaba private car","waPrefill":"Salam! NEOM → Aqaba.\n• Pickup: \n• Aqaba address / airport: \n• Date & time: \n• Passengers: \n(ref: neom-hub)"},{"id":"amman","icon":"route","label":"NEOM → Amman","short":"550 km","answer":"A long cross-border day, about 550 km (~6 hr 40 min). Stops planned in advance; border fees for the vehicle included.","send":["Pickup","Amman address","Date","Passengers"],"href":"/routes/neom-to-amman","linkLabel":"NEOM to Amman","waPrefill":"Salam! NEOM → Amman.\n• Pickup: \n• Amman address: \n• Date & time: \n• Passengers: \n(ref: neom-hub)"},{"id":"site","icon":"briefcase","label":"Site visits & business days","short":"Host arranges access","answer":"Contractors, consultants and visiting teams send the site and the access details their host gave them. We plan the car around the gate and the meeting time; access itself is arranged by the host.","send":["Company and site","Access details from your host","Date and time","Passengers"],"href":"/services/business-executive","linkLabel":"Executive transport","waPrefill":"Salam! NEOM site visit.\n• Company / site: \n• Access details: \n• Date & time: \n• Passengers: \n(ref: neom-hub)"},{"id":"alula","icon":"route","label":"NEOM ↔ AlUla","short":"402 km","answer":"Combining NEOM with AlUla is a long drive, about 402 km (~6 hr 43 min). Booked door to door with stops.","send":["Pickup","AlUla hotel","Date","Passengers"],"href":"/routes/neom-to-alula","linkLabel":"NEOM to AlUla","waPrefill":"Salam! NEOM → AlUla.\n• Pickup: \n• AlUla hotel: \n• Date & time: \n• Passengers: \n(ref: neom-hub)"},{"id":"long","icon":"route","label":"Riyadh or Jeddah ↔ NEOM","short":"Long-distance","answer":"For travellers who prefer the road to a flight, NEOM can be reached by car from Riyadh or Jeddah — a very long day, planned with stops.","send":["Pickup city","NEOM destination","Date","Passengers"],"href":"/routes/jeddah-to-neom","linkLabel":"Jeddah to NEOM","waPrefill":"Salam! Long-distance trip to NEOM.\n• From (Riyadh / Jeddah): \n• NEOM destination: \n• Date: \n• Passengers: \n(ref: neom-hub)"},{"id":"corporate","icon":"briefcase","label":"Delegations & contractors","short":"Written quote","answer":"Teams flying into TUU or RSI can have every airport leg and site day on one written quote. Corporate invoicing can be arranged through our sister company.","send":["Company","Dates and flights","Headcount","Sites"],"href":"/services/corporate","linkLabel":"Corporate transportation","waPrefill":"Salam! Corporate transport for NEOM.\n• Company: \n• Dates & flights: \n• Headcount: \n(ref: neom-hub)"}],"whatsappLink":"https://wa.me/966539388072"}]]}],"$L37","$L38","$L39","$L3a","$L3b","$L3c","$L3d","$L3e","$L3f","$L40"]}]
